# Frontend Environment Configuration Example

# API Endpoints
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:5000/api/v1

# Real-Time WebSocket Server
